stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft
    Draft --> Evaluation: owner and controls defined
    Evaluation --> Approved: quality and safety gates pass
    Evaluation --> Draft: remediation required
    Approved --> Active: authorized release
    Active --> Suspended: incident or policy breach
    Suspended --> Evaluation: remediation completed
    Active --> Retired: replacement or end of life
    Approved --> Retired: cancelled before release
    Retired --> [*]
